+def _reserve_dispatch(transport: Transport, store: StateStore, remote_root: str, final: ValidationResult) -> str:
+    """Write the durable remote record that a paid review is about to start for THIS request id and revision.
+    RESERVED: written now. ALREADY_OURS: the record exists, names this very job, and the local history shows an earlier
+    attempt that was refused before any work (the usage-limit retry). FOREIGN: a record exists that this watcher has no
+    history of (the local state was lost): the earlier run may have been paid, so no model is started. ERROR: the record
+    could not be written or read, so no model is started either."""
